+| Preset | Seed | Model | Solved | Grader result |
+|---|---:|---|---|---|
+| easy | 839002227 | `openai/gpt-5.6-terra` | no | first proposed pair conflict at `U(0,0,1,0)` |
+| easy | 672192354 | `google/gemini-3.8-flash` | no | proposed pair conflict at `U(0,31,4,43)` |
